{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Profit Calculator 是一款為創業者、自由工作者、零售商與網店賣家而設的商業計算工具，能快速計算利潤、毛利率、加成率、稅項及業務估值，協助你在定價與成本控制上作出更準確的判斷。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，適合需要即時掌握財務數據的經營者下載使用。</p>\n\n<h2>商業利潤與稅項計算</h2>\n<p>應用內建多項計算功能，輸入收入、銷貨成本與開支後即可得出淨利潤，亦可透過成本與售價反推毛利率及加成率。稅務部分支援在任意金額上加稅或抽出稅款，另可按年度收益估算業務價值。運算即時完成，介面簡潔易讀，並可查看近期計算紀錄。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-293-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-294-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-295-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-296-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-297-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Profit Calculator : ProfitPal</li>\n<li>應用類別：Finance</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-13T10:57:58.025141+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":319,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}